  "instance_name": "Drag_Performance",
  "label": "Drag Performance",
  "description": "The central figure is a drag performer, a cultural phenomenon rooted in LGBTQ+ communities, particularly in queer nightlife and performance art. Drag performance involves exaggerated costumes, makeup, and personas, often used to challenge gender norms and celebrate self-expression. Recognizing this context is necessary to understand the performer’s joyful expression and the meme’s celebration of identity and liberation.",
